.TH geectl-pull-request-show 1  "geectl-pull-request-show 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-pull\-request\-show \- Show one pull request: `obs:<id>` or `gitea:<owner>/<repo>#<number>`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl pull\-request show\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREFERENCE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show one pull request: `obs:<id>` or `gitea:<owner>/<repo>#<number>`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIREFERENCE\fR>
The pull\-request handle: `obs:<id>` or `gitea:<owner>/<repo>#<number>`
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
